<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/philip-v-of-macedon" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/philip-v-of-macedon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-15">15 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Sulpicius Galba and Aurelius Cotta become consuls in Rome</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Publius Sulpicius <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/galba">Galba</a> and Gaius Aurelius Cotta took office as consuls in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a>. Sulpicius, charged with Macedonia, persuaded the Comitia centuriata at a second session to vote for war on Philip V, beginning the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-macedonian-war">Second Macedonian War</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-macedonian-war">Second Macedonian War</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-republic">Roman Republic</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/philip-v-of-macedon">Philip V of Macedon</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-panium" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-panium.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-panium">Battle of Panium</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Panium was fought around 200 BCE near the sources of the Jordan River during the Fifth Syrian War, between the Seleucid Empire under Antiochus III and the Ptolemaic army under Scopas.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-baideng">Battle of Baideng</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Baideng took place in 200 BCE near present-day Datong in northern China.</p></div></li></ol></section>
